.TH DANBY-ROCKETINTRO 1
.SH NAME
danby-rocketintro \- introductory variable-mass vertical rocket
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/rocketintro
.SH MODEL
Thrust acceleration rises as propellant mass falls, ceases at burnout, and
competes with gravity and quadratic drag. Altitude and velocity are plotted.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/rocketintro.b
